<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudanese armed forces have continued drone strikes on markets in the disputed Abyei border region, killing dozens of civilians, while Sudan denies involvement and blames the RSF for the Abyei attack. Communal clashes persist between SSPDF and SPLA-IO forces in Kapoeta North, Eastern Equatoria, and in Wij-Panyikang, Upper Nile, with an ambush that killed two people in Kajo-Keji County. Monitors warned of rising violence ahead of December elections and reported 40,000 people displaced by renewed fighting in Upper Nile. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1Zc0dVWGU2SlJTeDhZYk12X1ZGWGpGVzJVYVFEckpRMjk4clY0SDZobE4zLU5oMzhoQXRXSWFUX2xyLVVfRFlyVGFVb2ctTVdmWHY3aE4wVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTkZja2JVNUJZenJ5Wlg3cEVkWVkzQkZvSmN5WmVoOXUwVG5kbW0zcExRdHIwYm5NWDJhNDlOcXpnWGpxZm5RbDJrU2hxTFVRVzJCZGVnYW1MVVFDU0tmZHB6S2tRWFNObWZSa0tQNnphSjJseWM4X3BrSDR0b0F6Vlp4OVU1aUJBNXVZaG1uZzZnWDY4d3VqNl9NbTUzeUxraUktMkNxbDVibTd0bTJ6cnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQYkFPYTJiU2Z2YTd5Zl9Reko0ZHltQS1WR0xmUllkOTNrNWY5bVVEcFFZSXZVMkNlZ0RFWUJKaU96U0lIclNpQWplOHpPU0VNcUFidXJ3UWlzWXFlTXMtNFZHNG9BV0diSmVYNFVFR2NzOW45aEFzT1lOaHBEdFpuWG9zUV9IU3Z2YVNhY0wzRDNJVUFtZkQ0ZGcySWRNOTB3OWFFNjFDZzVVNWRXX1dIWEJDbThGX0l5Q1h3Wg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQWm5lMWhUeVNyQVJLb3RUWXZtUlNtUU9mSFVpbGxsMjZXWXZocHlRc2d5a3E0emZkZkE0b3hiN0R5d0xrY3AxdWdzSVV2UWNKNEREQjhBUkJPdDJDa2hIVlVBM0ptamlTQjJHN